title: "When Is a Screenshot Evidence? Visual Evidence Provenance for Computer-Using Agents"
authors:
  - family-names: "Shukla"
    given-names: "Divyansh"
abstract: >-
  A measurement study of visual-evidence provenance in computer-using agents,
  examining scene-source recoverability, observation and inference policy,
  and assurance boundaries across retrospective traces and constructed
  graphical-environment experiments.
